{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/0/2809a1c1c59162c11570514fa7639e85fe72cc66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1000^2}{252^2-248^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"94\" height=\"39\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca3596fa3317edcd17f5a5319d250caab91cb8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\  }62,500 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\  }1,000 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 500\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  }250 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  } \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"461\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a> to factor the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominator</a>, yielding:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/7/937ca2c1fd1dff7262964503e84ab1582226a785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1000^2}{252^2-248^2}=\\frac{1000^2}{(252-248)(252+248)}=\\frac{1000^2}{(4)(500)}=\\frac{1000^2}{2000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"469\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>We see that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> in the denominator cancels with one of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />s in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Numerator\" title=\"Numerator\">numerator</a>, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/a/56a1ad67999d499128109fee44331c5160c1f2ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$500, \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"59\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" st